== Largest let-through a conductor could withstand = k2 S2 (same grid), so the fuse sheet's figure at 6 kA must be at or under it
Fuse sheet (SETfuse SCT520(P) V1.0): average melting I2t of the 10 A rating 500 A2s at 10 x 10 A; pre-arcing only. Clearing time and let-through at 6 kA: NOT STATED.
Rated breaking capacity of the 10 A rating: UL 10 kA at 250 VAC (covers 6 kA, 1.67x); CQC/TUV 2 kA at 250 VAC (6000/2000 = 3.0 x short)

